{"title":"Wednesday assorted links","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/953528771/0/marginalrevolution~Wednesday-assorted-links.html","date":1775666291000,"content":"<p>1. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/sarthakgh/status/2041489241406906503?s=46\" target=\"_blank\">Waymo rollout in NYC is halted</a>.</p>\r\n<p>2. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.nytimes.com/2026/04/08/business/bitcoin-satoshi-nakamoto-identity-adam-back.html\" target=\"_blank\">Back “plus” is the better answer</a> (NYT).  I am glad this is now settled, Alex T. can attest I have been insisting on this for a while.  Note <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2024/10/does-it-matter-who-satoshi-was.html\" target=\"_blank\">my earlier prediction</a>.</p>\r\n<p>3. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://nicholasdecker.substack.com/p/ludwig-straub-winner-of-the-john?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=747616&amp;post_id=193530245&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=false&amp;r=3o9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\">Nicholas Decker on Ludwig Straub</a>.</p>\r\n<p>4. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://arxiv.org/pdf/2603.28846\" target=\"_blank\">Crypto and quantum computing</a>.  Likely an important piece, here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://chatgpt.com/share/69d65c7d-7200-832d-af10-a1e6d08be7a1\" target=\"_blank\">GPT Pro on that paper</a>.</p>\r\n<p>5. “<span><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://thezvi.substack.com/p/ai-163-mythos-quest?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=573100&amp;post_id=192994504&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=3o9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\">The Suno upgrade for song generation seems quite good as well.</a>”  So much is new!</span></p>\r\n<p>6. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.nytimes.com/athletic/7175030/2026/04/06/nba-tanking-costs-blowouts/\" target=\"_blank\">Hollinger on NBA tanking</a> (NYT).</p>\r\n<p>7. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/shanaka86/status/2041854957071356028\" target=\"_blank\">Is there an evolving Iran bargain with China?</a> (speculative, mostly we still do not know what is going on, you should discount most of what you are reading on this topic).</p>\r\n<p>8. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/TheAnnaGat/status/2041911589851345080\" target=\"_blank\">Anna review of The Drama</a>.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/04/wednesday-assorted-links-548.html\">Wednesday assorted links</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/953528771/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/953528771/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/953528771/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/953528771/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/953528771/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/953528771/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://a